    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="Mayer (1937) expanded a real gas&#x27;s partition function in clusters of the Mayer function f(r)=e^{-u(r)/k_BT}-1. The first correction to the ideal-gas law, PV_m/RT=1+B_2(T)/V_m+\cdots, is">

